Sigmoid function: f(x) = 1 / (1+e^ -x)

Tanh function: f(x) = 2 / (1 + e ^ -2x) - 1

ReLU: f(x) = max(0, x)

Leaky ReLU: f(x) = x, if x > 0, else aX, where x is a small slope(eg. 0.01)

h:     shape (32, 64)      — batch of 32 examples, 64 hidden units each
W2:    shape (64, 27)      — weight matrix
b2:    shape (27,)         — bias
logits = h @ W2 + b2        — shape (32, 27)

The rule (memorize this — it comes up constantly)

dh  = dlogits @ W2.T
dW2 = h.T @ dlogits
db2 = dlogits.sum(0)

